          "code": "WMS_METRICS_SUMMARY",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1768425477170",
          "id": "1767988282890",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767988282893_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are a data summarization agent. You will receive an input JSON array of task records from: {{$context.$nodes.GETTASKBYTASKTYPES.$output}}. Each record will include:\n- \"task_type\" (string, e.g., FULL-LPN-PALLET)\n- \"task_nbr\" (string; eg: Task12345)\n- \"priority\" (number)\n- \"status_id\" (number)\n- \"status_desc\" (string, eg:\"Ready\")\n- \"order_nbr\" (string: eg: \"ORDER123\")\n- \"Ship Date\" (date)\n- \"order_status\" (string, eg: \"Created\")\n\nTasks:\n1. Group the filtered records by both order_nbr and task_type.\n2. Sort the records within each group by priority.\n3. Output format (exactly) in a multi Record widget:\n   - **Title:** Pending Orders by Task Type\n    - Columns: Order Nbr, Task Type, Priority(only show the largest value in the group)\n   - When a panel is expanded, additionally show the count of records for each Order Nbr and Task Type group with title: \"Number of Tasks\". Also show \"Lowest Task Status\" represented by status_desc corresponding to lowest value of status_id in the group and  show \"Highest Task Status\" represented by status_desc corresponding to lowest value of status_id in the group"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
