            {
              "id": "1768506522698_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Use output data from {{$context.$nodes.GETTASKBYTASKTYPES.$output}}:\nField mapping\n- WMS item:\n  -order_nbr=item[\"order_nbr\"]\n  - task_nbr = item[\"task_nbr\"]\n  - status_id = item[\"status_id\"]\n  - priority = item[\"priority\"]\n\n- Priority Actions (WMS)\n  - **Generate exactly ONE row under \"Priority Actions\" if ANY WMS task status id  < 30 and priority > 0\n  - shortDescription:\n    - List all qualifying order_nbr in a single sentence. Example:  \n      \"Tasks for {order_nbr1}, {order_nbr2}, ... can be prioritize—prioritize now.\"\n  - actionText: \"Update Priority\"\n  - followUpCommand: ora.Invoke(\"updatepriority\", {\"action\":\"updatepriority\",\"order_nbr\":\"<comma-separated order_nbr string>\",\"productContext\":\"wms\"})\n  - priority: \"true\"\n  - Render only under \"Priority Actions\".\n\nEdge cases\n- If no WMS tasks have status_id<30 and priority > 0, then:\n  - Priority Actions = empty\n  - Non-Priority Actions = empty (no eligible WMS orders to correlate)"
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
